Aim

To create an Amazon SNS topic, subscribe an email endpoint, and publish notifications through email using Amazon SNS.

Procedure
Step 1: Create SNS Topic
Login to Amazon Web Services AWS Management Console.
Search:
SNS
Open:
Amazon SNS
In left panel click:
Topics
Click:
Create Topic
Step 2: Configure Topic
Select:
Standard Topic

Enter:

MyEmailTopic
Leave remaining settings as default.
Click:
Create Topic
Step 3: Create Email Subscription
Open created SNS topic.
Go to:
Subscriptions
Click:
Create Subscription
Configure:
Field	Value
Protocol	Email
Endpoint	Your Email Address
Click:
Create Subscription
Step 4: Confirm Subscription
Open email inbox.
Open mail received from Amazon SNS.
Click:
Confirm Subscription

Subscription becomes active.

Step 5: Publish Test Message
Open SNS Topic.
Click:
Publish Message
Configure:
Field	Value
Subject	Test Mail
Message	Hello this is SNS test
Click:
Publish Message
Observation
SNS topic created successfully.
Email subscription confirmed.
Test notification email received successfully.
Result

Successfully created an SNS topic, subscribed an email endpoint, and sent notifications through Amazon SNS.
